tupitube (0.2.23-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Dependency update:
    - FFmpeg library updated to version 7.0.1.

  * New features:
    - Added "Duplicate Scene" action in the timeline and exposure table.
    - Enhanced motion tween table:
      Subpaths can now be updated in bulk by holding SHIFT while dragging.
    - Adjusted auxiliary mesh to align with workspace center; added border
      numbering.
    - Introduced dark theme with black background and white icons
      (Available in Preferences → Theme).
    - Added option to include audio when importing a video clip as an image
      sequence.
    - Added background context visibility in Foreground mode (toggle from top
      menu).
    - Implemented eraser tool for Pencil and Line tools (shortcut: “E”).

  * Bug fixes:
    - Fixed background transparency in image sequence exports.
    - Prevented reloading of open projects when reselected from “Open Recent”.

 -- TupiTube Team <info@tupitube.com>  Mon, 27 Oct 2025 18:30:00 +0000
